    "biography": "<p>Small brownish falcon-like birds of limited intelligence.</p><p>Trained by a bird-trainer, a Kýni can speak and is useful as a hunter or spy, reporting troops and terrain to its master. Lure one down with aromatic Tsúral buds (50%) or bring it down with blunt, sticky arrows. It cannot fight and always tries to escape; if shot at, roll 1d6: 1-2 it escapes, 6 it is killed. Hit dice 1-3 means half a hit die, rounded up.</p>",
